# Calls that need no access token. Submitting and inquiring need one:
# use samples/PriorAuth.SampleClient for those. Synthetic data only.
@host = http://localhost:5020

### What the server supports
GET {{host}}/fhir/metadata

### Where and how a provider system signs in
GET {{host}}/fhir/.well-known/smart-configuration

### Which services need authorization, and their paperwork
GET {{host}}/requirements

### The reviewer queue as JSON (same machine only)
GET {{host}}/internal/requests

### Registered provider systems (same machine only)
GET {{host}}/internal/clients
